.env
.env.*
!.env.example
.omc/
prisma/dev.db
prisma/dev.db-journal

# Security campaign SF-110 / review R6-N4 (lane C4, 10 Oct 2026): evidence, tests and tooling are never uploaded to
# the build. docs/ holds campaign evidence (logs, probe records); tests/ and scripts/ are not runtime code.
# The build command runs `node scripts/maybe-migrate.mjs && next build`, so that ONE script is re-included.
# (`scripts/*` rather than `scripts/` because a file cannot be re-included once its parent directory is excluded.)
docs/
tests/
scripts/*
!scripts/maybe-migrate.mjs
